<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/logo.png" type="image/png">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { background-color: #f4f6f9; }
    .card { border-radius: 12px; border: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .card-header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d62839, #b9182b); color: white; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0 !important; }
    .form-control, .form-select { font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-10">
        
        <div class="text-center mb-4">
          <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 80px;" class="mb-3">
          <h4 class="fw-bold text-danger">CHÀO MỪNG ĐẾN VỚI HỆ THỐNG PMCAX</h4>
          <p class="text-muted">Vui lòng hoàn tất thiết lập ban đầu trước khi truy cập.</p>
        </div>

        <% if (locals.messages && locals.messages.error) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-danger shadow-sm"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle me-2"></i><%= messages.error %></div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (locals.messages && locals.messages.warning) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-warning shadow-sm"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle me-2"></i><%= messages.warning %></div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header py-3" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2235, #2d3748); display: flex; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-right: 15px;"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
            <h5 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Bước 1: Đổi mật khẩu mặc định</h5>
          </div>
          <div class="card-header py-3" style="border-radius: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d3748, #4a5568); display: flex; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
            <div style="width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e63946; color: white; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(230,57,70,0.3); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-right: 15px;">2</div>
            <h5 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Bước 2: Khai báo thông tin cá nhân</h5>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body p-4">
            <form action="/onboarding" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
              <div class="row mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-3 mb-md-0">
                  <div class="border rounded bg-light d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-2 overflow-hidden" style="width: 150px; height: 180px;">
                    <img id="preview" src="/images/default-avatar.png" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;">
                  </div>
                  <label class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary w-100" style="max-width: 150px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-camera me-1"></i>Chọn ảnh 3x4
                    <input type="file" name="anhDaiDien" id="avatar" class="d-none" accept="image/*" onchange="document.getElementById('preview').src = window.URL.createObjectURL(this.files[0])">
                  </label>
                </div>
                
                <div class="col-md-9">
                  <h6 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-3 border-bottom pb-2">Thông tin cơ bản</h6>
                  <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                      <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Số hiệu CAND <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                      <input type="text" name="maSo" class="form-control" required placeholder="xxx-xxx" pattern="\d{3}-\d{3}">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                      <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Họ và tên <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                      <input type="text" name="hoTen" class="form-control" required value="<%= currentUser.hoTen %>">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                      <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Giới tính <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                      <select name="gioiTinh" class="form-select" required>
                        <option value="Nam">Nam</option>
                        <option value="Nữ">Nữ</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                      <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Ngày sinh <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                      <input type="date" name="ngaySinh" class="form-control" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                      <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Số CCCD</label>
                      <input type="text" name="soCCCD" class="form-control">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                      <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Số điện thoại</label>
                      <input type="text" name="soDienThoai" class="form-control">
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <h6 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-3 border-bottom pb-2">Thông tin công tác</h6>
              <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                  <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Cấp bậc</label>
                  <select name="capBac" class="form-select">
                    <option value="">-- Chọn --</option>
                    <% ranks.forEach(r => { %><option value="<%= r %>"><%= r %></option><% }) %>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                  <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Tổ công tác <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                  <select name="toCongTac" class="form-select" required>
                    <option value="">-- Chọn --</option>
                    <% teams.forEach(t => { %><option value="<%= t._id %>"><%= t.ten %></option><% }) %>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                  <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Ngày nhập ngũ <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                  <input type="date" name="ngayNhapNgu" class="form-control" required>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="alert alert-info py-2" style="font-size: 14px;">
                <i class="fas fa-info-circle me-2"></i> Chức vụ của bạn sẽ được hệ thống gán tự động dựa trên quyền tài khoản (<strong><%= currentUser.role.toUpperCase() %></strong>). Các thông tin khác có thể bổ sung sau khi truy cập.
              </div>

              <div class="text-end mt-4">
                <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-outline-secondary me-2"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt me-1"></i>Đăng xuất</a>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger px-4 fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i>Hoàn tất & Truy cập</button>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
